title: "Artefacts for: Maintaining a Temporal Knowledge Cube over Streaming Short Text: Dimension Evolution and Mergeable Semantic Measures"
abstract: >-
  Supplemental material and artefact for the ICDE 2027 submission: the compiled supplement
  (tables and figures omitted from the twelve-page body, plus appendices), the
  released scripts and raw outputs of twenty-two experiments, and the data
  manifest.
